Source: duckdb-fdw
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), postgresql-server-dev-all, g++, make, cmake (>= 3.15), ninja-build, python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/alitrack/duckdb_fdw

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-duckdb-fdw
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-duckdb-fdw
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Conflicts: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-duckdb
Description: DuckDB foreign data wrapper with an embedded DuckDB engine
 This package embeds DuckDB 2.0.0 built from PIC static archives. It includes
 Parquet, JSON and ICU and supports dynamic DuckDB plugins without requiring
 pg_duckdb or an external libduckdb. Select one DuckDB extension package per
 PostgreSQL major. Remove the previous extension's shared preload setting
 and restart PostgreSQL when switching packages; replacing packages does not
 unload libraries from existing server processes.
